*lstat* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''lstat(path)''

Returns file status information as a list, without following symbolic links.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String file path

*Returns:*
- List: [size, mtime, atime, ctime, mode, uid, gid, nlink, ino, dev, type]
  - ''mode'' is a 3 or 4 digit permission number (e.g. 755, 4755)
- ''err'' on failure
